		"To save the settings without the test, turn off scheduled synchronization.": "若要不經測試直接儲存設定，請關閉排程同步。",
		"Save the connection to Paperless first; then its tags appear here.": "請先儲存與 Paperless 的連線；之後其標籤會顯示在這裡。",
