		"The user %1$s exists in Paperless already. Updating it gives it exactly these permissions: %2$s. It also gets a new random password, which nobody needs, because the app signs in with its token. It is no Admin any more, and the permissions of its groups stay.": "使用者 %1$s 已存在於 Paperless 中。更新後，它將恰好擁有以下權限：%2$s。它還會取得一個新的隨機密碼，但沒有人需要這個密碼，因為本應用程式使用其 Token 登入。它將不再是管理者，其所屬群組的權限保持不變。",
